SUMMARY:Downbeat Blindfold Test with Special Guest Joe Lovano
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - Carhartt Amphitheater Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. DownBeat magazine's signature live "Blindfold Test" segment: Joe Lovano listens to unidentified recordings on the spot and reacts\, guesses the artists\, and discusses the music — a listening-and-conversation format rather than a live performance.
